      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Abaisiraeli kabiri baayonoona ye Musengwa Katonda. Musengwa Katonda yaabaleka okufugibwa Abafilisiti okumala emyaka amakumi ana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaaligho omusaadha, eriina lye nga ni Manoa, ow'e Zora, nga wa mu kika kya Dani. Mukazi we yali mugumba, nga tazaalangaku mwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho malaika wa Musengwa Katonda yaabonekera omukazi oyo, yaamukoba ati: “Oli mugumba, tozaalangaku mwana. Aye bona, oidha kutoola enda ozaale omwana mulenzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weekuume olobe kunhwa ku mwenge gwa mizabbibu oba ekitamiiza kyonakyona, waire okulya ku kintu kyonakyona ekitali kirongoofu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba bona, oidha kutoola enda ozaale omwana omulenzi. Omwana oyo taasalengaku nviiri ku mutwe gwe, kuba aidha kugheebwayo ye Katonda abe Munaziri okuva lw'alizaalibwa. Oyo n'alitoolera omulimo ogw'okununula isiraeli mu mikono gy'Abafilisiti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
