        },
        {
          "text": "Enimi edh'omuliro bwe dhaava ku alutaari, ni dhitumbukira ghaigulu, malaika wa Musengwa Katonda yaajiira mu nnimi edho ghaigulu, nga Manoa ni mukazi we babona. Agho Manoa ni mukazi we baakuba amakiryaivu, baakutama n'ebyeni byatuuka ku itaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wa Musengwa Katonda tiyairayo kubabonekera kabiri. Agho Manoa yaategeera ng'oyo abaire malaika wa Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
