              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye mukazi we yairamu ati: “Ngoli Musengwa Katonda abaire ayenda kutwita, tiyandituganhie kumugha ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa, n'ekyo eky'emere ey'empeke. Era tiyanditwoleike bino byonabyona, waire okutukobera ebintu ng'oti n'ebyo mpegaano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
